## Release

See [`docs/npm-publish-sop.md`](docs/npm-publish-sop.md) for the full publish flow.

Semver policy:
- `patch`: docs, metadata, tests, or backward-compatible fixes
- `minor`: backward-compatible user-visible features
- `major`: breaking CLI or runtime behavior changes

Do not bump the version for docs-only changes by default.

## Change Rules

- Keep the code dependency-free unless there is a strong reason not to.
- If behavior changes, update this file first or in the same change.
